 space"]],"deck":3,"blurb":"Both the business side and the cooking fall to you in this restaurant simulator. You assemble a kitchen from cooking surfaces, ovens and other equipment, hire staff, order ingredients from suppliers, set the menu and decorate, then step behind the stove for service. Finances and forecasts of how busy the evening will be help you avoid being swamped.\n\nThe menu draws on French, Italian and international dishes, which you can refine and adjust to the seasons and what customers expect. The long-term goal is recognition from the Michelin Guide. Chef Life is a single-player management sim that suits players who enjoy balancing planning and numbers with hands-on cooking."}}